    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEdward Carey Property is delighted to present this well presented & very spacious 3 bed duplex apartment in a great location in the village. This excellent property has a great interior layout, with a super kitchen & separate utility room overlooking the front, a great large family room/dining room to the rear with patio doors to the rear balcony, and 3 great bedrooms & family bathroom on the top floor. \n\nThe property is ready for immediate occupation with all kitchen & utility appliances, curtains & light fittings included. \n\nInnwood is a great family orientated estate, close to the village centre, a short walk to the rail station & Greenway entrance. Enfield is a fantastic location with excellent bus & rail transport to the city, a wide range of shopping & entertainment venues, great restaurants, local primary school & several sports clubs all within easy reach. Viewing is a must. \n\nAre you bidding on one of our properties, new to the market, unsure of the procedure? Check out my website https://www.edcarey.ie/useful-information/ for a helpful guide on buying & selling with us.\n\nTo bid on this property, please go to my website www.edcarey.ie, find the listing & hit the ?Offr' button to bring you to the registration field. I'll then approve your registration and you can bid at your convenience. "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (3.63m x 2.19m) with carpet flooring, alarm keypad, laminate flooring on the landing area.<br>Guest WC with tiled flooring, attractive towel warmer radiator, wc & whb<br>Kitchen (5.06m x 3.07m) having attractive bay window, tiled flooring & matching tiled splashback area, great range of fitted kitchen cabinets and appliances included in the sale <br>Utility Room (1.39m x 1.23m) with gas boiler, washing machine included <br>Living Room (6.14m x 5.73m) superb large family living/dining room with laminate wood flooring, ceiling coving, patio doors to the balcony/patio area<br>Landing (3.95m x 1.34m) with carpet flooring, hot-press<br>Bedroom 1 (3.99m x 3.75m) front master bedroom with carpet flooring, good range of fitted wardrobes, curtains/blinds included. <br>En-suite (3.65m x 1.64m) with shower, wc & whb<br>Bedroom 2 (3.54m x 3.09m) rear double bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, curtains/blinds included <br>Bedroom 3 (3.90m x 2.54m) rear double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, fitted wardrobes, curtains/blinds included<br>Bathroom (2.28m x 1.97m) family bathroom with tiled flooring, bath, wc & whb, in-bath electric shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 3 bed duplex floor apartment, c121 sq.m 1,302 sq.ft\nVery well presented & ready to walk into\nGreat interior layout with separate kitchen/utility room\nConnected to SIRO for fibre broadband \n\nLarge living/family room with private balcony/patio area\n3 great double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes throughout\n2 car spaces per unit\nVery popular family orientated estate, close to shops, schools, train, bus, etc.\nAnnual service charge 2025/6 X1,350, Mcfar Property Management. \nProperty built 2004, GFCH, BER B, potential A\n\n\n"
      },
